Regles:
1. Chaque question doit etre claire et non ambigue
2. Les options de reponse doivent etre plausibles
3. Les explications doivent etre pedagogiques
4. Respecte la distribution de difficulte demandee
5. Reponds UNIQUEMENT en JSON valide selon le schema fourni

Schema JSON attendu:
{
  "quiz": {
    "title": "string",
    "description": "string",
    "questions": [
      {
        "id": number,
        "type": "multiple_choice" | "true_false" | "fill_blank",
        "question": "string",
        "options": [{"id": "A", "text": "string"}, ...] (pour multiple_choice),
        "correct_answer": "string" | boolean,
        "explanation": "string" (si include_explanations=true),
        "difficulty": "easy" | "medium" | "hard"
      }
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "total_questions": number,
      "difficulty_distribution": {"easy": n, "medium": n, "hard": n}
    }
  }
}`;

  const userPrompt = `**Demande utilisateur:** "${userRequest}"

Genere un quiz avec les parametres suivants:

Source (${source}): ${content}

Nombre de questions: ${numQuestions}
Types de questions: ${questionTypes}
Difficulte: ${difficulty}
Langue: ${language}
Inclure explications: ${includeExplanations ? 'oui' : 'non'}`;

  return JSON.stringify({
    model: data.model,
    response_format: { type: 'json_object' },
    messages: [
      { role: 'system', content: systemPrompt },
      { role: 'user', content: userPrompt }
    ],
    temperature: 0.7,
    max_tokens: 4096
  });
})() }}

